{"name":"Aloof","hex":"#d4e2e6","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"aloof","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["At or from a distance, but within view, or at a small distance; apart; away.","Without sympathy; unfavorably."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Either physically or emotionally remote: distant, standoffish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aloof"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Aloof","blocks":[{"text":"The Aloof were a British electronic music group, formed in London, England, in 1990. The group consisted of Ricky Barrow, Gary Burns, Jagz Kooner, Richard Thair, and Dean Thatcher. They were active during the 1990s, and released four studio albums: Cover the Crime (1994), Sinking (1996), Seeking Pleasure (1998), and This Constant Chase for Thrills (1999)."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Aloof","wikidata":"Q693391"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"aloof":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aloof.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aloof.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aloof.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aloof.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-aloof.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Werner's nomenclature of colours greys","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Werner%27s_nomenclature_of_colours_greys.jpg/500px-Werner%27s_nomenclature_of_colours_greys.jpg","ratio":0.794047619047619,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Werner%27s_nomenclature_of_colours_greys.jpg","share":0.455},{"title":"Proud and aloof - Flickr - flyone","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Proud_and_aloof_-_Flickr_-_flyone.jpg/500px-Pr